{"id":"nave:hur","source":"nave","name":"Hur","slug":"hur","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"1. An Israelite who assisted in supporting Moses’ hands during battle Ex 17:10,12; 24:14","refs":[["Exod",17,10,17,10],["Exod",17,12,17,12],["Exod",24,14,24,14]]},{"text":"2. A son of Caleb Ex 31:2; 35:30; 38:22; 1Ch 2:19,20; 2Ch 1:5","refs":[["Exod",31,2,31,2],["Exod",35,30,35,30],["Exod",38,22,38,22],["1Chr",2,19,2,19],["1Chr",2,20,2,20],["2Chr",1,5,1,5]]},{"text":"3. A king of Midian Nu 31:8; Jos 13:21","refs":[["Num",31,8,31,8],["Josh",13,21,13,21]]},{"text":"4. Called Ben Hur, an officer of Solomon’s commissary, (margin) 1Ki 4:8","refs":[["1Kgs",4,8,4,8]]},{"text":"5. Father of Caleb 1Ch 2:50; 4:4","refs":[["1Chr",2,50,2,50],["1Chr",4,4,4,4]]},{"text":"6. A son of Judah 1Ch 4:1","refs":[["1Chr",4,1,4,1]]},{"text":"7. A ruler Ne 3:9","refs":[["Neh",3,9,3,9]]}],"refCount":16}
